The models in this folder were used in the ablation study.
Each model has three versions, each trained with a different random seed setting. 
The model "pdcvrptw-dynamic-tf-normalized-..." was labeled as the base model in the PDCTRPTW plots in the ablation study.
The model "pdtrp-joshi-..." is the base model for the PDTRP training method plot. 
The "pdtrp-dynamic-..." uses adjacency based edge features and the "pdtp-distances..." uses distance based edge features.